        <type>constexpr int64_t</type>
        <definition>constexpr int64_t ONNX_LIGHT_NAMESPACE::onnx_optim::shapes::generator::kConstantValueAsShapeMaxElements</definition>
        <argsstring></argsstring>
        <name>kConstantValueAsShapeMaxElements</name>
        <qualifiedname>ONNX_LIGHT_NAMESPACE::onnx_optim::shapes::generator::kConstantValueAsShapeMaxElements</qualifiedname>
        <initializer>= 8</initializer>
        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Maximum element count of a <computeroutput>Constant</computeroutput> value tensor for which :cpp:func:<computeroutput>ComputeShapeConstant</computeroutput> populates the output :cpp:func:<computeroutput>OptimTensor::ValueAsShape</computeroutput> annotation. Constants beyond this threshold are not data-propagated (the output dtype and shape are still inferred normally). </para>
        </detaileddescription>
